暗い道に目が慣れずに 踏み出すのも怖かった
My eyes couldn't adjust to the dark road, and stepping forward was terrifying.

222
00:31:49,569 --> 00:31:53,569
そんな時 やっと見えた光
At times like that, the light I finally saw—

223
00:31:57,069 --> 00:32:04,069
絶対君は歌ってて！ ただのエゴとわかってても 君はキラキラ衣装が似合う！
You must definitely sing! Even knowing it's just my ego, sparkling outfits suit you best!

224
00:32:10,569 --> 00:32:17,569
絶対大きなステージで 一列でも前で感じたい 今日の歌い方 なんか好きだなあ
On a definitely huge stage, I want to feel you even a row closer. Somehow I really like the way you sing today.

225
00:32:24,569 --> 00:32:29,869
君の努力 私の愛 成り立つ この関係は
Your hard work and my love—this relationship stands upon them,

226
00:32:30,069 --> 00:32:41,569
強くて脆いの 星の幸せを 願った だけど でもね だって君はアイドルよ
so strong yet fragile. I wished for the star's happiness, but... Even so, because you're an idol!

227
00:32:46,069 --> 00:32:53,569
初めて目が合った日から 今日も明日も 君ばかりだ
Ever since our eyes met for the first time, today and tomorrow it's all about you!

228
00:32:55,569 --> 00:33:00,069
絶対アイドル辞めないで！ これは報われないおとぎ話
