クソ野郎共が
You bastards—

247
00:35:00,234 --> 00:35:03,367
前略 幕が開けたそのオノマトペ
Zenryaku, the curtain opened that onomatopoeia...

248
00:35:03,367 --> 00:35:06,117
着飾る人形は ピエロにくちづけを
...the adorned dolls give a kiss to the clown.

249
00:35:06,217 --> 00:35:09,617
本日 大団円 脚本が笑う
Today is a grand finale, the script laughs,

250
00:35:09,617 --> 00:35:13,317
騙されてくれる貴方達と
along with you who let yourselves be fooled.

251
00:35:13,317 --> 00:35:16,317
アタシ今ここで何をしてる？
What am I even doing here right now?

252
00:35:18,617 --> 00:35:21,417
前略 幕が開けたそのオノマトペ
Zenryaku, the curtain opened that onomatopoeia,

253
00:35:21,417 --> 00:35:25,317
着飾る人形は ピエロにくちづけを
and the adorned dolls give a kiss to the clown.

254
00:35:25,417 --> 00:35:28,917
本日 大団円 脚本が笑う
Today's grand finale, the script laughs,

255
00:35:28,917 --> 00:35:31,617
騙されてくれる貴方達と
along with you who let yourselves be fooled.

256
00:35:31,617 --> 00:35:35,617
アタシ今ここで何をしてる？
What am I doing here right now?

257
00:35:50,217 --> 00:35:53,317
耳をつんざく 拍手喝采
