フォーカスされた日常
a focused everyday life,

260
00:35:59,917 --> 00:36:03,117
引き金を抱いて心中するように
as if holding a trigger to commit double suicide.

261
00:36:03,317 --> 00:36:06,117
一回 二回 三回 嘘を重ねて
One time, two times, three times, stacking lies,

262
00:36:06,117 --> 00:36:09,917
十回 千回 億回 瞳を逸して
Ten times, a thousand times, a hundred million times, looking away,

